# Phase J — приёмка restaurant-desktop (online reconcile + months offline)

**Ship version candidate:** bump `restaurant-desktop/package.json` (was 0.1.29) → **0.1.30** when cutting the build.  
**Scope:** Windows hall PC only. Do not mix with Aurent Cashier / pharmacy.

## Pre-build

- [ ] `restaurant-service` edge profile builds (includes `EdgeCloudSyncService`, `LiveShiftReconcile`, staff applier).
- [ ] `pnpm` / prepare: UI bundle + jar in resources.
- [ ] No network chrome / status strip under header (still `return null`).
- [ ] LAN hub: packaged default ON; boot log shows `LAN phones: http://…`.

## Smoke — offline months (local)

- [ ] Cold start after bootstrap: floor open table, dish, kitchen ticket, pay cash — without internet.
- [ ] Shift open/close local.
- [ ] Stock receipt local.
- [ ] PIN / password login against local roster.

## Smoke — online reconcile (88551-style)

- [ ] With network: change password / deactivate user in cloud → within ~1 min (or reconnect) login on PC fails / kick after roster refresh.
- [ ] Close shift in cloud, empty floor on PC → local OPEN closes after live pull.
- [ ] Local open tables still present → local shift NOT force-closed.
- [ ] After offline sales: reconnect → outbox flush reduces pending (no manual sync button).
- [ ] Catalog: new dish on cloud appears on PC after reconnect or ≤15 min.
- [ ] Stock products refresh after reconnect or ≤15 min.

## Smoke — LAN hub

- [ ] Phone on same Wi‑Fi opens `http://<LAN-IP>:17887` (port from boot log).
- [ ] Kitchen/waiter sees same open tickets as hall PC.
- [ ] Hall window still `127.0.0.1` (not broken by hub).

## Smoke — honesty

- [ ] Billing page: text about r-aurent.uz, no fake invoices; POS not blocked.
- [ ] Reports/audit subtitles: local hall data (desktop).

## Ship commands (when user asks)

```bash
cd restaurant-desktop
# bump version in package.json if needed
pnpm run dist:win
pnpm run manifest
```

Upload Windows artifact + manifest to restaurant-desktop downloads feed only.

## Known accepted gaps (not blockers for 0.1.30)

- Bookings not in live cloud↔edge slice (local hall OK).
- STOCK_* outbox not pushed to cloud ingest (balances via periodic pull).
- No network/queue chrome by product choice.
